OL,3,GNEWSAEarly bird photographers catch
OL,4,Astriking sunrise
OL,5,
OL,6,FHues of amber, indigo and orange lit up
OL,7,Fthe skies over north east England this
OL,8,Fmorning to the delight of the region's
OL,9,Fphotographers.
OL,11,FDog walkers and cargo ship workers were
OL,12,Famong those to see a spectacular
OL,13,Fsunrise show near Tynemouth beach,
OL,14,Fwhile BBC Weather Watchers were out in
OL,15,FRedcar and Roker.
OL,17,FDawn opened up over the horizon at
OL,18,FNorth Tyneside at 06:21 BST, as
OL,19,Fmeteorological autumn nudges on the
OL,20,Fshorter days.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
